** Units: mm-MPa. A deck carries no units; the caller states them when reading (ADR-0003).
** Material values from the public library dataset ncamp-im7-8552-2019-rtd-measured-v1 (record revision 2026-10-10.1,
** rights: open publisher), converted to MPa: E1 162095.74, E2 8963.18, nu12 0.316, G12 4688.43, ply 0.18288 mm.
** G13 is set equal to G12 and G23 is a nominal 3000 MPa; Abaqus syntax requires both and anisotropy_fea does not use them.
** *Fail Stress magnitudes are the same dataset's F1t, F1c, F2t, F2c, F6 in MPa. The sign Abaqus expects for the
** compressive limits is UNVERIFIED; anisotropy_fea uses magnitudes (fea/docs/abaqus-export-recipe.md).
